data gunbc_strategy_note: String = "The instantiated strategy graph (operator directive 2026-08-01). This carrier holds only facts: instances of the kernel concepts and their typed relations. All status is derived by kernel functions and asserted only in witnesses; nothing here stores a stage, verdict, or claim status."

