    ],
    composition_rule: "conjunction over the required-operation path: the contract is served when every child holds for every required operation class; children are independent mechanisms over one materialization substrate",
    coverage: PartialCoverage {
      open_note: "adopted PARTIAL by operator decision (review 2026-08-02): the universal contract stays permanently open - bounded programs discharge local obligations beneath it, and no finite initiative list completes it without a complete population of required operation paths (discovery, scheduling, regen unexamined); CompleteCoverage requires an operator-authorized coverage rule over such a population, whose derivation then establishes completeness",
    },
  },
