    parent_contract: "contract-v2-self-host-fixed-point",
    parent_criteria_digest: "criteria|every compiler module is either self-emitted green-by-execution or a declared seed-retained row with reason and trigger|self-emitted means produced by v2's own emitter with no old-generator reachability and behavioral equivalence on a discriminating corpus|the emitter reproduces itself through two generations before the remaining stages are claimed|the fixed point is behavioral equivalence, never byte identity",
