      "obl-spice-simulation-profile",
      "obl-verilog-hardware-profile",
      "obl-python-general-source-profile",
      "obl-c-accelerator-kernel-profile",
    ],
    composition_rule: "shared denominator first, then per-target profile closures: registry, census, gate, receipt shape, and projection are target-generic mechanisms every profile closure consumes; per-target obligations close their declared profiles against that denominator",
    coverage: PartialCoverage {
      open_note: "P0 product profiles (typescript, web) and P1 experimental profiles (spice, verilog, python, c-accelerator) are enumerated; Rust bootstrap is deliberately absent - governed by the two self-host contracts, referenced never duplicated; P2/P3 targets (go, llvm-ir, wasm, lean, java, kotlin, swift, sql, machine-code, english, ecmascript, structured media) enter through registry rows under criterion 1, so CompleteCoverage additionally requires the registry to enumerate them with explicit profile-or-parked dispositions; grounding receipt: the live containment witness executed FAIL 2026-08-02 with three unexempted importers (roadmap_component, design/theme_transition, effect_plan_bash_materialize) while excluded from CI discovery and the falsifier - the gate obligation's exact starting state (capture doc 2026-08-02-language-support-completion-review.md)",
    },
  },
]

