data selfhost_pilot_note: String = "Second pilot (audit 2026-08-02), RECUT the same evening per the discharge-graph review (docs/strategy/2026-08-02-discharge-graph-review.md). Current shape: contract-v2-self-host-fixed-point carries the fixed-point chain only - production cutover split to contract-v2-production-cutover, old-generator deletion a future downstream retirement contract. gunb-ai/gunbc#7264 DISCHARGES the narrower obl-translate-instantiation-wrap-decision, a declared ObligationPrerequisite of remaining-stages: the parent unblocking is DERIVED by strategy_blockers_discharged while the parent stays open - unblocked-not-advanced as a derivation rather than an authored kind (Finding 1; ClosesPrerequisite retained only for non-obligation prerequisites, zero uses). gunb-ai/gunbc#7627 DISCHARGES obl-frontier-classifier-totality (measurement machinery); the corrected candidate census is a deliberately absent observation (corrected_census_subject), so strategy_measurement_readiness derives MeasurementAbsent and first-module selection is NOT READY - the former Open decision row was deleted, and the recorded rule is: derive the first eligible candidate from the frontier tractability sweep order once the census observation lands, escalating to the operator only on genuine incomparability (Findings 2, 6). The remaining-stages denominator derives from the PUBLIC v2.compiler.self_host.frontier compiler_frontier_roster via selfhost_module_obligation_ids (27 modules, 0 discharged) - a generic remaining-stages contribution cannot move the count (Finding 4). Near-miss controls witnessed: 7599, 7664, and 7605 all carry zero self-host bindings (Finding 8). Dissolve-on for the private/public seam: when a public ProgramContract digest surface exists, the private bare-minimum binding reds on public criteria drift (review, authority-direction section)."

